flowchart TD
StartNode["**Start**<br/>Initialize MOO run"]

ProblemDef["**Problem Definition**<br/>Objectives Minimize WIP and<br/>Maximize Throughput<br/>Inputs Six buffer capacities {1-10}"]

PopulationInit["**Population Initialization**<br/>POP SIZE 50<br/>Generate individuals with<br/>capacities that satisfy sum <= 30"]

EvalPool["**Evaluation Worker Pool**<br/>Parallel pool using N CORES 50<br/>Maps population to evaluate individual"]

EvaluateIndividual["**Evaluate Individual**<br/>Runs simulation for 3 seeds<br/>Returns averaged WIP and negative throughput<br/>Returns None for infeasible individuals"]

SimulationModel["**Production Simulation Model**<br/>Existing simpy model run_simulation<br/>Inputs buffer capacities vector<br/>Outputs throughput WIP and machine energy"]

GatherResults["**Gather Results**<br/>Collect evaluation outputs<br/>Filter infeasible individuals<br/>Append valid results to CSV"]

NonDominatedSort["**Non Dominated Sort**<br/>fast non dominated sort<br/>Computes Pareto fronts and ranks"]

CrowdingDist["**Crowding Distance**<br/>Compute distance inside front<br/>Used to prefer diverse solutions"]

Replacement["**Population Replacement**<br/>Form new population from Pareto fronts<br/>Use crowding to trim to POP SIZE"]

SelectionReproduction["**Selection and Reproduction**<br/>Tournament selection<br/>Crossover and Mutation<br/>Create offspring population"]

ConstraintHandler["**Constraint Handler**<br/>Enforce sum capacities <= 30<br/>If no feasible individuals reinitialize population"]

ResultsOutput["**Results Output**<br/>Write generation results to results CSV<br/>Close worker pool at end of optimization"]

EndNode["**End**<br/>Optimization complete<br/>Pareto set and CSV available"]

StartNode --> ProblemDef
ProblemDef --> PopulationInit
PopulationInit --> EvalPool
EvalPool --> EvaluateIndividual
EvaluateIndividual --> SimulationModel
SimulationModel --> EvaluateIndividual
EvaluateIndividual --> GatherResults
GatherResults --> NonDominatedSort
NonDominatedSort --> CrowdingDist
CrowdingDist --> Replacement
Replacement --> SelectionReproduction
SelectionReproduction --> ConstraintHandler
ConstraintHandler --> EvalPool
Replacement -->|If final generation reached| ResultsOutput
ResultsOutput --> EndNode